From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:01:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/21] images: pull only from sfcd over the engine socket; no
 registry access

Every manifest and blob comes from sfcd (purpose 37, daemon/seafield/imagesrc).
A pull needs name@sha256; the repository sent is the name as written
(reference.FamiliarName). Registry hosts, endpoints, auth and search are
refused, so neither pulls, push, login, search nor BuildKit reach a registry.

